    "methods_description": "Simultaneous EEG-ESG-ENG-EMG recordings, including electrocardiographic and respiratory signals, were collected from each participant across nine conditions: resting state with eyes open, mixed median and tibial nerve stimulation, and sensory nerve stimulation of the index finger, middle finger, first toe, second toe, and simultaneous stimulation combinations. ESG electrode positions were also recorded. The EEG channel Fz was referenced to both the right mastoid (EEG reference) and the 6th thoracic vertebra (ESG reference).",
